WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.533 --> 00:00:02.535
Good evening, I'm Seth Meyers,
this is "Late Night."

00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:03.836
Hope you're doing well tonight.

00:00:03.836 --> 00:00:06.339
Now, if you don't mind,
I'm gonna get to the news.

00:00:06.339 --> 00:00:08.508
After teasing
a "major announcement"

00:00:08.508 --> 00:00:11.044
on his social media
platform Truth Social,

00:00:11.044 --> 00:00:13.112
former President Trump
announced today

00:00:13.112 --> 00:00:16.216
he is releasing a collection of
digital trading cards.

00:00:16.216 --> 00:00:20.320
It's what his doctors are
calling "a new symptom."

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:22.322
[ Laughter ]

00:00:22.322 --> 00:00:23.656
That's right,
former President Trump

00:00:23.656 --> 00:00:26.091
is releasing a collection
of digital trading cards

00:00:26.091 --> 00:00:27.660
that chronicle his
life and career,

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:29.829
like that time he won
the Super Bowl,

00:00:29.829 --> 00:00:32.164
or that time he won NASCAR,

00:00:32.164 --> 00:00:35.602
or that time he went to
space and didn't need a helmet.

00:00:35.602 --> 00:00:37.036
[ Laughter ]

00:00:37.036 --> 00:00:39.606
I know, we always thought
he was Forrest Gump,

00:00:39.606 --> 00:00:41.608
but apparently he does, too.

00:00:41.608 --> 00:00:43.209
[ Laughter ]

00:00:43.209 --> 00:00:45.044
First lady, Dr. Jill Biden
has reportedly grown

00:00:45.044 --> 00:00:47.413
more enthusiastic
over the last three months

00:00:47.413 --> 00:00:49.181
about the possibility
of President Biden

00:00:49.181 --> 00:00:50.616
running for a second term.

00:00:50.616 --> 00:00:52.752
Anything to put off her
having to deal with

00:00:52.752 --> 00:00:54.186
a newly retired guy.

00:00:54.186 --> 00:00:55.922
[ As Biden ] Get ready, babe,
because I'm about to

00:00:55.922 --> 00:00:58.525
get into model trains
big-time!

00:00:58.525 --> 00:00:59.992
[ Laughter ]

00:00:59.992 --> 00:01:01.694
[ Normal voice ] The Biden
administration announced today

00:01:01.694 --> 00:01:04.230
that U.S. households can now
order an additional

00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:06.666
eight free at-home COVID tests.

00:01:06.666 --> 00:01:09.536
It's the perfect gift for the
person who has everything but

00:01:09.536 --> 00:01:12.438
isn't sure if it's the flu,
COVID, or RSV.

00:01:12.438 --> 00:01:14.273
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.273 --> 00:01:17.843
The United Nations voted
yesterday to remove Iran

00:01:17.843 --> 00:01:20.279
from a panel which promotes
women's rights,

00:01:20.279 --> 00:01:22.614
which is kind of like
Arby's being stripped

00:01:22.614 --> 00:01:24.150
of its Michelin star.

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:28.721
[ Laughter ]

00:01:28.721 --> 00:01:29.922
I think they still have one,

00:01:29.922 --> 00:01:33.826
because I think they got
two Michelin stars.

00:01:33.826 --> 00:01:36.562
Goldman Sachs is reportedly
considering cutting bonuses

00:01:36.562 --> 00:01:38.164
this year for
investment bankers.

00:01:38.164 --> 00:01:40.966
As for how they're cutting it --
with baking powder!

00:01:40.966 --> 00:01:42.435
All right.

00:01:42.435 --> 00:01:44.437
[ Laughter ]

00:01:44.437 --> 00:01:47.039
It's not fair to say
all finance guys do cocaine,

00:01:47.039 --> 00:01:48.474
just the winners!

00:01:48.474 --> 00:01:51.010
[ Laughter ]

00:01:51.010 --> 00:01:54.146
Producers yesterday released a
trailer for a new reality series

00:01:54.146 --> 00:01:55.615
called "MILF MANOR."

00:01:55.615 --> 00:01:56.816
[ Laughter ]

00:01:56.816 --> 00:01:59.786
"MILF MANOR?"
You mean Williams-Sonoma?

00:01:59.786 --> 00:02:03.789
[ Laughter ]

00:02:03.789 --> 00:02:05.491
Isn't that what that's called?

00:02:05.491 --> 00:02:07.926
I'm genuinely asking.

00:02:07.926 --> 00:02:10.796
And finally, a deer in India
recently got stuck

00:02:10.796 --> 00:02:12.899
in an ATM vestibule.

00:02:12.899 --> 00:02:15.568
But good luck trying to get
just one buck

00:02:15.568 --> 00:02:17.336
out of an ATM.

00:02:17.336 --> 00:02:20.039
[ Scattered laughter ]

00:02:24.143 --> 00:02:27.580
And that -- and that was how
Brian Donaldson

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:29.015
ruined Christmas.

00:02:29.015 --> 00:02:30.383
[ Laughter ]

00:02:30.383 --> 00:02:32.752
You guys, that was the
monologue, everybody!

